<title>SPAIN: Spain's Meff derivatives bourses resume trade.</title>
<headline>Spain's Meff derivatives bourses resume trade.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The two Spanish financial derivatives exchanges resumed trade at about 1040 GMT, after technical difficulties delayed the open, the exchanges said.</p>
<p>Madrid-based Meff equities derivatives exchange was to resume at 1040 GMT, while Barcelona-based Meff fixed income derivatives exchange had opened trade minutes earlier.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
